        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Astronomy; a translucent diagram of the phases of the Moon. Wellcome V0025021.jpg",
        "credit": "John Emslie",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Astronomy;_a_translucent_diagram_of_the_phases_of_the_Moon._Wellcome_V0025021.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 6.9,
          "end": 10.333,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 10.32,
      "end": 13.56,
      "text": "They tracked emergency visits across every single lunar phase.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Moon Phase and Libration, 2025 (SVS5415 - orbit 0120 print).jpg",
        "credit": "NASA's Scientific Visualization Studio - USRA/Ernie Wright, NASA/GSFC/Noah Petro, ADNET Systems, Inc./James Tralie",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Moon_Phase_and_Libration,_2025_(SVS5415_-_orbit_0120_print).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 10.333,
          "end": 13.567,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 13.56,
      "end": 17.18,
      "text": "Full moon admissions were identical to four normal lunar days.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wellcome Collection",
        "title": "Astronomy: the 28 phases of the moon in a lunar month. Engraving by P. Miotte.",
        "credit": "Wellcome Collection",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://wellcomecollection.org/works/kfzjpurt"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 13.567,
          "end": 17.167,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 17.18,
      "end": 20.54,
      "text": "Apparent surges are just weekend traffic patterns in disguise.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "City Traffic Illuminated City Life Night City Street Night Photography Nightlife Motion (32861900291).jpg",
        "credit": "OiMax from Tokyo, Japan",
        "license": "CC BY 2.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:City_Traffic_Illuminated_City_Life_Night_City_Street_Night_Photography_Nightlife_Motion_(32861900291).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 17.167,
          "end": 20.533,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 20.54,
      "end": 24.5,
      "text": "Decades of meta-analyses prove the real correlation is zero.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "designed card"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 20.533,
          "end": 24.5,
          "kind": "designed",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 24.5,
      "end": 28.62,
      "text": "Moonlight guides marine coral spawning, yet leaves human behavior untouched.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Purple Coral (30880349792).jpg",
        "credit": "Tony Hisgett from Birmingham, UK",
        "license": "CC BY 2.0",
